## Implementation Notes

### tomeClasses

Knights can find tomes from:
- Paladin (base) - 11 spells
- Priest (healing spells) - 8 spells
- Rogue (mobility/parry) - 2 spells
- Warrior (parry/crit) - 2 spells
- Death Knight (buffs/defense) - 2 spells
- Mage (intellect) - 2 spells
- Hunter (parry/stats) - 3 spells

```lua
tomeClasses = { 2, 5, 4, 6, 1, 8, 3 }  -- Paladin, Priest, Rogue, DK, Warrior, Mage, Hunter
```

**Note**: Trainers only teach spells the Knight actually knows. A Warrior trainer
spawning for a Knight can ONLY teach Deflection R5 and Flurry R5. A Hunter trainer
can ONLY teach Deflection R3, Combat Experience R2, and Counterattack. This is by
design - trainers are filtered by the custom class spell list.

### Talent Learning via AIO

High-level talents (normally require level 40+) are learned through:
1. AIO addon on login
2. Server reset relearning
3. Periodic refresh when needed

These talents are in the spell list but flagged for special handling since
they can't be learned from normal trainers due to level requirements.

